diagram "Migration to rows-only library support"
subtitle "Each stage passes the survey gate; stage 5 may move only assumed ends"

node st1 "1 · Access-path field [1]\nequivalence test, 286 rows" color=mint
node st2 "2 · One path emitter\ndeletes readers, option emitters" color=mint
node st3 "3 · Cell shape\ndeletes connectStores, state pairs" color=mint
node st4 "4 · Slot shape\ndeletes connectSolidFor, Show" color=mint
node st5 "5 · Type proposals\nproof type-signature, assumed" color=amber shade=300
node st6 "6 · Confirm rows\nabout 25 rows shrink to 1 line" color=mint
node st7 "7 · Drop name lists\nFRAMEWORK_CALLS, STATE_CALLS" color=mint

edge a st1 -> st2
edge b st2 -> st3
edge c st3 -> st4
edge d st4 -> st5
edge e st5 -> st6
edge f st6 -> st7

footnote 1 "Start after tonight's zustand, React Query and Solid workers merge: they edit the same readers."

legend mint "Survey gate: no moves"
legend amber "Survey gate: assumed ends may move, ok list may not grow" shade=300

